ons.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Water-Cooler-Repair-Service-near-me-in-vadodara-scaled.webp\" alt=\"water cooler repair services daman\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\" title=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h3 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-2\">Water Cooler</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Commercial water cooler repair for schools and offices.</p>\n                        <a href=\"/water-cooler-repair-services-daman\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline\">Read More &rarr;</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 4 -->\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white border rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/deep-freezer-repair-service-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"deep freezer repair services daman\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\" title=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h3 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-2\">Deep Freezer</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Fixing cooling issues for ice cream and medical freezers.</p>\n                        <a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-daman\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline\">Read More &rarr;</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                 <!-- Card 5 -->\n                 <div class=\"service-card bg-white border rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/Packaged-Air-Conditioner-Selection-and-Buying-Guide-By-Atlas-Aircon.png\" alt=\"central ac repair services daman\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\" title=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h3 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-2\">Central/Packaged AC</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Industrial and mall HVAC system troubleshooting.</p>\n                        <a href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-daman\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline\">Read More &rarr;</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                 <!-- Card 6 -->\n                 <div class=\"service-card bg-white border rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/rittal-panel-ac-service.webp\" alt=\"panel ac service daman\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\" title=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h3 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-2\">Panel AC Service</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">Specialized CNC and server rack cooling solutions.</p>\n                        <a href=\"/panel-ac-service-daman\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline\">Read More &rarr;</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Additional Links Text Block -->\n            <div class=\"mt-12 bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl text-sm text-gray-500\">\n                <p class=\"font-bold mb-2\">Other Services We Provide:</p>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n                    <a href=\"/air-cooler-repair-services-daman\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600 underline\">Air Cooler Repair</a>\n                    <a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-daman\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600 underline\">Chiller Repair</a>\n                    <a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-daman\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600 underline\">Cold Room Services</a>\n                    <a href=\"/ducting-repair-services-daman\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600 underline\">Ducting Repair</a>\n                    <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-daman\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600 underline\">HVAC Maintenance</a>\n                    <a href=\"/package-ac-service-daman\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600 underline\">Package AC</a>\n                    <a href=\"/cassette-ac-service-daman\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600 underline\">Cassette AC</a>\n                    <a href=\"/precision-ac-service-daman\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600 underline\">Precision AC</a>\n                    <a href=\"/refrigerator-service-center-daman\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600 underline\">Refrigerator Center</a>\n                    <a href=\"/ac-repair-cost-daman\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600 underline\">AC Repair Cost</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PRICE LIST TABLE -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-2\">Window AC Service Price List Daman</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-8\">Transparent pricing with no hidden costs. We provide the most **affordable window ac service daman**.</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto shadow-xl rounded-xl\">\n                <table class=\"w-full bg-white text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white\">\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Service Description</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Price Range (INR)</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Warranty</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-100\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border font-semibold\">General Service (Dry/Wet)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹399 &#8211; ₹499</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">7 Days</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-100\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border font-semibold\">Power Jet Service (Deep Clean)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹599 &#8211; ₹799</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">30 Days</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-100\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border font-semibold\">R22 Gas Refill (Top-up/Full)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹1400 &#8211; ₹2400</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">90 Days</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-100\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border font-semibold\">R32 / R410 Gas Refilling</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹1600 &#8211; ₹2800</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">90 Days</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-100\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border font-semibold\">Window AC Installation</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹500 &#8211; ₹800</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">30 Days</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-100\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border font-semibold\">Window AC Uninstallation</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹300 &#8211; ₹500</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">N/A</td>\n                        </tr>\n                         <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-100\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border font-semibold\">Capacitor Replacement</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹450 &#8211; ₹850</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">Manufacturer Warranty</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-100\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border font-semibold\">PCB Repair</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹1200 &#8211; ₹2500</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">30 Days</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-4\">*Prices are subject to change based on model and condition. Taxes extra as applicable.</p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- BUY/SELL & SPARES -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8\">\n            <div class=\"md:w-1/2 bg-blue-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-blue-100\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-blue-800\"><i class=\"fas fa-shopping-cart\"></i> Buy &#038; Sell Used ACs</h3>\n                <p class=\"mb-4\">Looking to upgrade? We buy old window ACs and sell refurbished units at great prices.</p>\n                <ul class=\"list-disc ml-5 space-y-2 mb-6 text-gray-700\">\n                    <li>Best scrap value for old ACs.</li>\n                    <li>Refurbished ACs with 6-month warranty.</li>\n                    <li>Exchange offers available.</li>\n                </ul>\n                <a href=\"/shop\" class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded shadow hover:bg-blue-700 transition\">Visit Shop</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"md:w-1/2 bg-orange-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-orange-100\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-orange-800\"><i class=\"fas fa-cogs\"></i> Genuine Spare Parts</h3>\n                <p class=\"mb-4\">We stock 100% original spares for Voltas, LG, and Hitachi window ACs.</p>\n                <ul class=\"list-disc ml-5 space-y-2 mb-6 text-gray-700\">\n                    <li>Copper Pipes &#038; Insulation.</li>\n                    <li>Compressors (Rotary/Reciprocating).</li>\n                    <li>Remote Controls &#038; PCB Boards.</li>\n                </ul>\n                 <a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"bg-orange-600 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded shadow hover:bg-orange-700 transition\">Enquire Spares</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ERROR CODES SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-800 text-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">Common Window AC Error Codes &#038; Solutions</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-700 p-6 rounded-lg\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-yellow-400 text-xl mb-2\">E1 / E2 Error</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\">Usually indicates a room temperature sensor fault. Requires sensor replacement.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-700 p-6 rounded-lg\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-yellow-400 text-xl mb-2\">E3 Error</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\">Coil sensor issue. This prevents the compressor from working correctly. Call technician.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-700 p-6 rounded-lg\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-yellow-400 text-xl mb-2\">E5 / E6 Error</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\">Communication error between PCB and display, or fan motor malfunction.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-700 p-6 rounded-lg\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-yellow-400 text-xl mb-2\">EC Error</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\">Refrigerant leak detection. System shuts down to prevent compressor damage.</p>\n                </div>\n                 <div class=\"bg-gray-700 p-6 rounded-lg\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-yellow-400 text-xl mb-2\">F1 / F2 Error</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\">Compressor protection or voltage fluctuation issues. Check stabilizer.</p>\n                </div>\n                 <div class=\"bg-gray-700 p-6 rounded-lg\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-yellow-400 text-xl mb-2\">P4 Error</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm\">Evaporator temperature too high or too low. Needs professional diagnosis.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- SERVICE AREAS SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">Areas We Serve in Daman</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8\">\n                <!-- Residential -->\n                <div class=\"flex-1\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-blue-600 border-b pb-2\">Residential Areas</h3>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed max-h-60 overflow-y-auto pr-2 custom-scroll\">\n                        Nani Daman | Moti Daman | Dunetha | Kathiria | Dabhel | Bhimpore | Marwad | Kadaiya | Varkund | Somnath | Ringanwada | Kachigam | Magarwada | Patlara | Damanwada | Pariyari | Zari | Devka | Bhenslore | Jampore.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Industrial -->\n                <div class=\"flex-1\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-orange-600 border-b pb-2\">Industrial &#038; GIDC Areas</h3>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed max-h-60 overflow-y-auto pr-2 custom-scroll\">\n                         Dabhel Industrial Estate | Bhimpore Industrial Estate | Kadaiya Industrial Estate | Somnath Industrial Area | Kachigam Industrial Area | Ringanwada Industrial Area | OIDC Industrial Estates | Mahatma Gandhi Udyog Nagar.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQ SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-10\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                \n                <details class=\"group bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border p-4 cursor-pointer\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        How much does Window AC service cost in Daman?\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm\">Our basic window AC service starts from ₹399. For jet pump deep cleaning, the charges are ₹599. Gas filling charges depend on the refrigerant type (R22/R32).</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"group bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border p-4 cursor-pointer\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        Do you provide service in Dabhel Industrial Estate?\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm\">Yes, we have a specialized team for **Dabhel Industrial Estate**, Bhimpore, and Kadaiya for commercial and industrial AC servicing.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"group bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border p-4 cursor-pointer\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        Is there a warranty on AC repair parts?\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm\">Yes, we provide a 30-day warranty on service and up to 3 months warranty on spare parts replacement like compressors or PCBs.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"group bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border p-4 cursor-pointer\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        Can you fix water leakage from my Window AC?\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm\">Absolutely. Water leakage is often caused by a blocked drain pipe or dirty tray. Our **window ac drainage repair daman** service resolves this instantly.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"group bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border p-4 cursor-pointer\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        How often should I service my Window AC?\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm\">We recommend servicing your AC at least twice a year—once before summer starts (March) and once after the season ends.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"group bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border p-4 cursor-pointer\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        Do you repair old models of Voltas or LG ACs?\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm\">Yes, our technicians are trained to handle all brands including old models of Voltas, LG, Samsung, Hitachi, and Carrier.</p>\n                </details>\n\n                 <details class=\"group bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border p-4 cursor-pointer\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        Do you refill R22 gas?\n                        <span class=\"text-blue-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i></span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm\">Yes, we stock R22, R32, and R410A refrigerants. We check for leaks before refilling to ensure longevity.</p>\n                </details>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FOOTER -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-gray-900 text-white pt-16 pb-8\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-12\">\n                \n                <!-- About -->\n                <div>\n                    <h5 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Atlas Aircon</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4\">\n                        Trusted HVAC solutions in Daman &#038; Diu. We provide end-to-end repair, installation, and maintenance for residential and industrial cooling systems across Daman, Vapi, and Silvassa.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white\"><i class=\"fab fa-facebook fa-lg\"></i></a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white\"><i class=\"fab fa-instagram fa-lg\"></i></a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white\"><i class=\"fab fa-youtube fa-lg\"></i></a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Quick Links -->\n            